 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "My branch is ready. Today I push it to the team's server. I point to the input. I process data. I push changes slowly. Now I can pull changes. I say the new pattern twice: I'd like to order ... Leo asks, \"Could I have ...?\" I feel good today.",
   "tts": "My branch is ready. Today I push it to the team's server. I point to the input. I process data. I push changes slowly. Now I can pull changes. I say the new pattern twice: I'd like to order  Leo asks, \"Could I have ?\" I feel good today.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "我的分支准备好了。今天我把它推送到团队的服务器上。我指着输入。我处理数据。我慢慢推送更改。现在我会拉取更改了。我把新句型读了两遍：我想点……Leo问：\"我可以要……吗？\"我今天感觉很好。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "input",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "输入，程序接收到的数据"
    },
    {
     "w": "process data",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "处理数据，按照规则改变或分析数据"
    },
    {
     "w": "I'd like to order ...",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我想点……"
    },
    {
     "w": "Could I have ...?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我可以要……吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "push changes",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "推送更改，把本地提交发送到远程仓库"
    },
    {
     "w": "pull changes",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "拉取更改，取得并合并远程的新提交"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "The team orders lunch together, and I order too. Maria smiles and says, \"What do you recommend?\" I answer, \"No ice, please.\" This is the output value. I see the function. I try to fetch updates. Maria shows me the origin remote. I learn one new thing.",
   "tts": "The team orders lunch together, and I order too. Maria smiles and says, \"What do you recommend?\" I answer, \"No ice, please.\" This is the output value. I see the function. I try to fetch updates. Maria shows me the origin remote. I learn one new thing.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "团队一起点午餐，我也点了。Maria微笑着说：\"你推荐什么？\"我回答：\"请不要加冰。\"这是输出值。我看到了函数。我试着获取更新。Maria 给我看了origin 远程。我学到了一件新东西。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "output value",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "输出值，程序处理后返回的结果"
    },
    {
     "w": "function",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "函数，可以重复调用的一组指令"
    },
    {
     "w": "What do you recommend?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "你推荐什么？"
    },
    {
     "w": "No ice, please.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "请不要加冰。"
    },
    {
     "w": "fetch updates",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "获取更新，只下载远程信息而暂不合并"
    },
    {
     "w": "origin remote",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "origin 远程，克隆仓库时默认的远程名称"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I do one last thing. I point to the upstream remote. I sync with remote. This is the parameter. I see the return value. Leo says, \"Could we have the bill?\" and I say, \"Is service included?\" I pull the team's new code before I leave. We are in sync now.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I do one last thing. I point to the upstream remote. I sync with remote. This is the parameter. I see the return value. Leo says, \"Could we have the bill?\" and I say, \"Is service included?\" I pull the team's new code before I leave. We are in sync now.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我做最后一件事。我指着upstream 远程。我与远程同步。这是参数。我看到了返回值。Leo说：\"可以给我们账单吗？\"我说：\"包含服务费吗？\"离开前，我拉取了团队的新代码。我们同步了。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "parameter",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "参数，函数定义中接收输入的名字"
    },
    {
     "w": "return value",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "返回值，函数完成后交回的结果"
    },
    {
     "w": "Could we have the bill?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "可以给我们账单吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "Is service included?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "包含服务费吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "upstream remote",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "upstream 远程，通常指原始项目的远程仓库"
    },
    {
     "w": "sync with remote",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "与远程同步，让本地和远程进度保持一致"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
